description = "The Maul breaks into the ground and a shockwave runs {radius} m ahead in a {b:FAULT_LINE_ARC} degree cone, dealing {hit} Physical damage plus {d:BREAK_PER_CRACK} for each Crack in it, and {b:STAGGER_MAUL_EXTRA} more Stagger, to every enemy in it. Full damage to up to {b:AOE_TARGET_CAP} enemies; with more, it is split evenly between all of them. The next weapon on your Wheel comes into your hands."
